  on light OR dark artwork, in either theme (the same "shadow behind the glyph"
  trick the grid title text uses). Self-coloured — do NOT tint at the use site.
  The pastel FALLBACK tiles (audio/doc) use plain cloud_done_24 tinted
  colorOnSurfaceVariant instead; see DownloadItemAdapter.
-->
